ppens as a  result of that shooting  is often comically played out but the  fact is we we all  are pretty much the same we all have a  sport caller we all have some kind of  crazy uncle who  you know who shows up at christmas and  takes his teeth out or an aunt who has  50 cats that does something wild  and this is it gives us a chance to  forgive ourselves you know and  and we have to understand we are a  dysfunctional  but loving family um and that helps that  helps get me out of bed every morning  yeah me too me too because i so believe  and sport coat  who shot the drug dealer who we used to  coach in baseball  and part of the mystery was why did he  do that i love how you tied it all  together we thank you james mcbride  i'm curious what did you think when  oprah called you and said hey you're my  choice what did you think  oh man i mean i used to tell my brother  i said i never win nothing  no i can't say that you know it was a  great moment i i wish everyone could  experience  that feeling i recognized her voice  right away by the way  even though you know so let it be known  i knew who i was talking  i knew who it was okay all right  because a lot of people go this ain't  really you this ain't really you oprah  thank you james mcbride  congratulations dinkin deacon rather  king kong  there's a there's a story about king  kong that that too is on sale now  wherever you like to read your books and  you can read an excerpt of oprah's new  book club selection on  cbsthismorning.com

